  "index_additions": "      <li><a href=\"/research/free-chain-nash-intersection-counterexample/\">A free-chain counterexample to a Nash-intersection conjecture</a><br><span class=\"entry-meta\">22 October 2026 · Unrefereed preprint</span><p>Complete free-chain Nash intersections give five-blowup counterexamples to a specified reference-divisor assertion, with explicit contact and indexing limits.</p><p><a href=\"/research/free-chain-nash-intersection-counterexample/assets/free-chain-nash-intersections.pdf\">PDF</a> · <a href=\"https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23578599\">Zenodo</a></p></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/research/projective-line-quotient-rogalski-sierra-algebra/\">A projective-line quotient of the Rogalski–Sierra algebra</a><br><span class=\"entry-meta\">16 October 2026 · Unrefereed preprint</span><p>For every field with β²≠1, an exact Rogalski–Sierra algebra quotient is a projective-line twisted ring with a completely prime kernel and GK dimension two.</p><p><a href=\"/research/projective-line-quotient-rogalski-sierra-algebra/assets/paper.pdf\">PDF</a> · <a href=\"https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23423736\">Zenodo</a></p></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/research/robinson-ideal-only-tangency-certificates/\">A Robinson counterexample to ideal-only tangency certificates</a><br><span class=\"entry-meta\">12 October 2026 · Unrefereed preprint</span><p>Robinson’s nonnegative sextic resists polynomial sums of squares modulo two tangency ideals, even after adding any nonnegative constant.</p><p><a href=\"/research/robinson-ideal-only-tangency-certificates/assets/robinson-tangency-certificates-v1.0.pdf\">PDF</a> · <a href=\"https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23333002\">Zenodo</a></p></li>\n",
